1
00:00:06,688 --> 00:00:08,926
[The seeker passes by BAILEY]

2
00:00:10,407 --> 00:00:11,936
[TARZZAN]

3
00:00:22,639 --> 00:00:25,650
I found you, TARZZAN!

4
00:00:28,044 --> 00:00:31,116
[TARZZAN's scream]

5
00:00:31,701 --> 00:00:33,639
What's that sound?

6
00:00:35,255 --> 00:00:37,312
Did someone get caught?

7
00:00:37,408 --> 00:00:39,127
Oh no, TARZZAN is screaming

8
00:00:39,128 --> 00:00:40,355
He's screaming

9
00:00:40,356 --> 00:00:41,991
That's TARZZAN

10
00:00:41,992 --> 00:00:43,083
He's screaming

11
00:00:43,597 --> 00:00:46,059
[TARZZAN is off to prison]

12
00:00:46,403 --> 00:00:48,239
[BAILEY left alone after TARZZAN got caught]

13
00:00:52,197 --> 00:00:54,076
Oh my god

14
00:00:54,898 --> 00:00:56,056
Wow

15
00:00:56,038 --> 00:00:57,107
This is...

16
00:01:03,289 --> 00:01:05,814
I thought it was an actual ghost

17
00:01:06,243 --> 00:01:11,561
[If you can't get out of prison within 20 minutes, you won't be able to leave until the game is over]

18
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:15,138
[Phone notification sound]
What's this?

19
00:01:17,253 --> 00:01:18,476
[A member has been imprisoned]

20
00:01:18,477 --> 00:01:21,292
-TARZZAN!
-A member, I think it's TARZZAN

21
00:01:21,293 --> 00:01:23,959
They must've been imprisoned

22
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:26,439
I need to go save them

23
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:27,940
but

24
00:01:28,541 --> 00:01:31,908
I have to stay hidden here

25
00:01:32,041 --> 00:01:34,772
[Basement has no service]

26
00:01:37,428 --> 00:01:39,379
[Got no text]

27
00:01:43,156 --> 00:01:44,806
Oh my goodness...

28
00:01:45,678 --> 00:01:48,108
Should I be staying here?

29
00:01:48,072 --> 00:01:51,032
[No service area]

30
00:01:55,584 --> 00:01:58,477
[The seeker is currently on the second floor]

31
00:02:09,831 --> 00:02:12,568
[ANNIE, WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO on 3F]
-Should we go save TARZZAN or not?

32
00:02:12,569 --> 00:02:13,790
Let's take a break together

33
00:02:13,791 --> 00:02:15,208
and just survive until the end

34
00:02:15,209 --> 00:02:16,272
Okay

35
00:02:16,528 --> 00:02:17,719
TARZZAN is probably getting enough airtime

36
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:20,140
-while he's alone in prison
-Yeah

37
00:02:20,121 --> 00:02:21,794
I feel like he'll be working out and stuff

38
00:02:21,795 --> 00:02:22,512
You're right

39
00:02:22,831 --> 00:02:25,102
This is killing me

40
00:02:25,791 --> 00:02:28,856
Oh no, I went down to the basement

41
00:02:28,857 --> 00:02:31,374
to rescue BAILEY

42
00:02:31,375 --> 00:02:33,273
I had no idea the seeker would catch me

43
00:02:33,758 --> 00:02:36,335
Is it possible

44
00:02:36,336 --> 00:02:38,271
to break out of prison?

45
00:02:39,339 --> 00:02:41,329
This is right up my alley

46
00:02:41,330 --> 00:02:42,949
so if we can break out...

47
00:02:44,266 --> 00:02:46,776
As long as my head can fit,
I can break out

48
00:02:47,009 --> 00:02:48,193
[Members' phone numbers]
-Hold up

49
00:02:48,194 --> 00:02:49,844
I have their phone numbers

50
00:02:49,845 --> 00:02:52,023
[If you can't escape prison within 20 minutes,
you won't be able to leave until the game is over]
-Okay, first of all...

51
00:02:55,903 --> 00:02:59,301
[ANNIE, Seeker, WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO on 3F]

52
00:02:59,302 --> 00:03:00,571
TARZZAN

53
00:03:00,572 --> 00:03:01,882
-take a good break over there
-They're coming

54
00:03:01,883 --> 00:03:03,364
Be quiet

55
00:03:04,393 --> 00:03:05,916
The seeker is here

56
00:03:05,917 --> 00:03:10,247
[ANNIE, Seeker, WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO on 3F]

57
00:03:15,859 --> 00:03:17,586
[Phone notification sound]

58
00:03:24,614 --> 00:03:26,151
I turned it off

59
00:03:26,152 --> 00:03:27,333
How do you turn it off?

60
00:03:29,081 --> 00:03:30,306
I turned it off

61
00:03:30,642 --> 00:03:32,795
Hello?

62
00:03:32,796 --> 00:03:34,397
WOOCHAN?

63
00:03:34,398 --> 00:03:35,779
He's not picking up

64
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:37,401
That's so cruel

65
00:03:37,744 --> 00:03:39,213
[WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO]
[The Seeker heard the phone ring]

66
00:03:39,214 --> 00:03:42,335
[Enters the room]

67
00:03:42,856 --> 00:03:44,296
The Seeker is here

68
00:03:44,418 --> 00:03:46,958
[WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO]

69
00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:50,952
[There's only a wall between these two and the seeker]

70
00:03:59,897 --> 00:04:04,999
[Seeker]

71
00:04:21,816 --> 00:04:24,124
[Seeker wandering around the balcony]

72
00:04:25,416 --> 00:04:28,984
[Turns around and leaves the room]

73
00:04:32,043 --> 00:04:33,912
Wow, it just passed by us

74
00:04:33,913 --> 00:04:35,850
It left?

75
00:04:37,628 --> 00:04:40,538
[Sound of WOOCHAN's sigh]

76
00:04:40,539 --> 00:04:43,404
[Sound of the seeker]
[ANNIE, WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO on 3F]

77
00:04:43,789 --> 00:04:46,204
Someone is moving, right?

78
00:04:46,912 --> 00:04:48,724
Who's that over there?

79
00:04:58,764 --> 00:05:02,877
[Seeker, ANNIE, WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO on 3F]

80
00:05:02,878 --> 00:05:03,754
[ANNIE]

81
00:05:03,755 --> 00:05:06,069
[ANNIE]
It's coming this way

82
00:05:06,723 --> 00:05:09,950
[Seeker getting closer to ANNIE]

83
00:05:10,913 --> 00:05:13,050
I'm terrified, what do I do?

84
00:05:15,766 --> 00:05:21,082
[ANNIE, Seeker, WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO on 3F]

85
00:05:21,665 --> 00:05:23,820
It's out there! I can see it.

86
00:05:33,167 --> 00:05:36,485
[Already right in front of her]

87
00:05:36,486 --> 00:05:40,111
[ANNIE]

88
00:05:56,510 --> 00:05:59,069
I found you, ANNIE!

89
00:05:59,638 --> 00:06:01,124
I'll go

90
00:06:01,125 --> 00:06:03,971
[ANNIE is off to prison]

91
00:06:04,660 --> 00:06:05,733
What if everyone else got caught?

92
00:06:05,734 --> 00:06:07,038
Aside from us?

93
00:06:07,039 --> 00:06:08,552
That could be the case

94
00:06:08,794 --> 00:06:10,301
But we both turned off our phones

95
00:06:10,302 --> 00:06:13,202
so we wouldn't know if we got anything

96
00:06:15,580 --> 00:06:16,952
Why didn't you pick up?

97
00:06:17,858 --> 00:06:19,478
Why didn't you pick up?

98
00:06:19,479 --> 00:06:20,642
How am I supposed to pick up?

99
00:06:20,643 --> 00:06:22,698
I've been calling you guys

100
00:06:22,699 --> 00:06:24,148
but nobody is picking up

101
00:06:25,043 --> 00:06:26,531
Oh, you did call

102
00:06:27,468 --> 00:06:29,368
She's in the no service area though

103
00:06:29,369 --> 00:06:31,253
[TARZZAN gives BAILEY a call]

104
00:06:31,375 --> 00:06:35,914
[BAILEY]
[As expected, BAILEY's phone doesn't ring]

105
00:06:36,439 --> 00:06:38,902
This is terrifying

106
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:42,513
[Calls WOOCHAN again]

107
00:06:42,947 --> 00:06:44,958
His phone is completely off

108
00:06:45,435 --> 00:06:47,461
He must've turned it off
because it was too loud

109
00:06:49,022 --> 00:06:50,739
What if he doesn't know it's us?

110
00:06:50,740 --> 00:06:52,412
But I have a key

111
00:06:52,380 --> 00:06:53,846
-Really?
-Yeah

112
00:06:54,308 --> 00:06:55,709
Excuse me...

113
00:06:56,561 --> 00:06:58,203
Hey!

114
00:06:58,204 --> 00:06:59,778
Are you going to escape without me?

115
00:06:59,779 --> 00:07:01,005
One is better than none

116
00:07:01,220 --> 00:07:03,729
Hurry and bring a key

117
00:07:03,730 --> 00:07:05,580
I only have ten minutes left
until I'm stuck here forever

118
00:07:05,581 --> 00:07:06,830
Hold up

119
00:07:07,064 --> 00:07:09,036
[ANNIE escapes prison]

120
00:07:13,704 --> 00:07:16,650
[ANNIE escapes prison]

121
00:07:16,651 --> 00:07:19,016
[ANNIE, WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO on 3F]

122
00:07:19,017 --> 00:07:20,902
[ANNIE escapes prison
goes to the third floor]

123
00:07:23,023 --> 00:07:26,645
[She goes in the fire cabinet?]

124
00:07:28,254 --> 00:07:30,435
[Sound of the fire cabinet closes]

125
00:07:31,489 --> 00:07:34,003
I better hide in here

126
00:07:35,612 --> 00:07:37,934
There's even a fan waiting for me here

127
00:07:38,329 --> 00:07:40,662
I have a fan as well

128
00:07:42,284 --> 00:07:45,261
[ANNIE, WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO on 3F]

129
00:07:45,262 --> 00:07:45,987
[BAILEY]

130
00:07:45,988 --> 00:07:48,252
But I'm literally

131
00:07:48,253 --> 00:07:50,364
terrified right now

132
00:07:50,365 --> 00:07:53,519
[BAILEY on B1]

133
00:07:54,396 --> 00:07:57,052
[Seeker came down to the basement]

134
00:08:00,353 --> 00:08:04,026
[BAILEY and Seeker on B1]

135
00:08:04,027 --> 00:08:06,486
[BAILEY]

136
00:08:07,481 --> 00:08:09,385
[Seeker]

137
00:08:14,167 --> 00:08:17,200
[Sound of the seeker]

138
00:08:22,047 --> 00:08:24,074
[Couldn't find BAILEY and leaves]

139
00:08:27,558 --> 00:08:30,285
That's scary

140
00:08:30,286 --> 00:08:31,497
I'm sweating

141
00:08:31,498 --> 00:08:32,859
even though I'm not moving

142
00:08:32,860 --> 00:08:33,783
Yeah

143
00:08:34,040 --> 00:08:35,945
Is it like,
only those that endure the pain

144
00:08:35,946 --> 00:08:38,611
can win or something?

145
00:08:39,176 --> 00:08:42,208
[Seeker heads up the stairs]

146
00:08:45,262 --> 00:08:48,076
[Arrived on the third floor]
[Seeker] [ANNIE]

147
00:08:48,127 --> 00:08:50,428
[Sound of the seeker]

148
00:08:50,429 --> 00:08:54,733
[Seeker, ANNIE, WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO on 3F]

149
00:08:54,734 --> 00:08:56,764
I figured out a good method

150
00:08:56,765 --> 00:08:57,429
What is it?

151
00:08:57,641 --> 00:08:59,068
If the seeker comes

152
00:08:59,069 --> 00:09:00,540
we can just hold the door

153
00:09:05,344 --> 00:09:11,874
[Seeker]
[WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO]

154
00:09:12,129 --> 00:09:13,611
What if they come from up here?

155
00:09:13,612 --> 00:09:16,172
Like they put their hair down like this?

156
00:09:21,152 --> 00:09:23,653
[Sound of the seeker]

157
00:09:28,501 --> 00:09:29,927
It's here

158
00:09:29,928 --> 00:09:34,963
[ANNIE, Seeker, WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO on 3F]

159
00:09:43,507 --> 00:09:45,458
[Sound of the door closing]

160
00:09:45,708 --> 00:09:47,762
I think it left

161
00:09:50,072 --> 00:09:52,046
No

162
00:09:54,890 --> 00:09:56,901
I found you, WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO!

163
00:10:01,517 --> 00:10:04,179
[WOOCHAN and YOUNGSEO off to prison]

164
00:10:04,490 --> 00:10:05,954
Oh, there's one person here

165
00:10:05,955 --> 00:10:07,116
TARZZAN!

166
00:10:07,117 --> 00:10:08,158
Hey you traitors

167
00:10:08,159 --> 00:10:09,047
Why?

168
00:10:09,048 --> 00:10:10,935
Do you know how many times I called you?

169
00:10:10,936 --> 00:10:11,867
That was you?

170
00:10:11,868 --> 00:10:12,919
We turned off our phones

171
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:14,647
We almost died because of you

172
00:10:14,648 --> 00:10:15,784
I'm dead in two minutes

173
00:10:15,785 --> 00:10:18,035
No, I have two keys right now

174
00:10:18,036 --> 00:10:19,090
so I can save you

175
00:10:19,091 --> 00:10:20,895
but do you know
what the best plan looks like right now?

176
00:10:20,896 --> 00:10:21,962
-What?
-You have to stay here

177
00:10:21,963 --> 00:10:23,419
in prison for as long as you can

178
00:10:23,631 --> 00:10:25,619
BAILEY is alone in the basement

179
00:10:25,620 --> 00:10:27,055
in the no service area, I think

180
00:10:27,056 --> 00:10:27,716
Really?

181
00:10:27,717 --> 00:10:29,541
Then since you don't have much time left

182
00:10:29,542 --> 00:10:30,835
Let's go together

183
00:10:30,836 --> 00:10:31,699
We can't

184
00:10:31,700 --> 00:10:33,084
-You can go by yourself
-I'm scared

185
00:10:33,085 --> 00:10:35,160
We're going to stay here
as long as possible

186
00:10:35,551 --> 00:10:36,504
Hurry and save him

187
00:10:36,505 --> 00:10:37,561
-Wait for now
-Save him

188
00:10:37,562 --> 00:10:39,934
[Only 20 seconds left to escape]
-I have 20 seconds left
-He only has 20 seconds left, save him

189
00:10:39,935 --> 00:10:42,005
We'll save TARZZAN

190
00:10:42,006 --> 00:10:44,203
-No, after five seconds
-No, save him now

191
00:10:44,204 --> 00:10:46,157
You have to find a key

192
00:10:46,158 --> 00:10:48,340
Find a key and then go to BAILEY

193
00:10:48,617 --> 00:10:50,660
[TARZZAN escapes prison with WOOCHAN's key]
-I'm begging you

194
00:10:50,661 --> 00:10:53,225
Don't let my key go to waste

195
00:10:56,033 --> 00:10:58,716
[TARZZAN escapes prison]

196
00:10:58,717 --> 00:11:00,260
[Phone notification sound]

197
00:11:01,792 --> 00:11:09,334
[Key hint, 1st floor]

198
00:11:13,372 --> 00:11:16,676
[TARZZAN listens to WOOCHAN and
looks for the key]

199
00:11:16,844 --> 00:11:19,070
Where's the helmet?

200
00:11:33,406 --> 00:11:34,484
[Phone notification sound]

201
00:11:34,485 --> 00:11:36,015
I got another message

202
00:11:39,255 --> 00:11:42,622
Once you only have 2,222 seconds
of playtime left

203
00:11:42,623 --> 00:11:44,850
the seeker will disappear

204
00:11:44,851 --> 00:11:49,071
The seeker will disappear
and you'll be given four minutes to hide

205
00:11:49,072 --> 00:11:51,533
The four minutes begin
when the hide and seek song plays

206
00:11:51,534 --> 00:11:55,840
and you're unable to save members
during those four minutes

207
00:11:55,841 --> 00:11:59,823
After the four minutes,
there'll be two seekers, so hide better

208
00:11:59,824 --> 00:12:01,437
There's going to be two seekers?

209
00:12:01,438 --> 00:12:02,120
Yeah

210
00:12:02,485 --> 00:12:04,159
Hold on! We're reaching 2,222 seconds

211
00:12:09,919 --> 00:12:12,454
[Alarming them that it's 2,222 seconds ]

212
00:12:12,455 --> 00:12:14,174
Sheesh

213
00:12:14,452 --> 00:12:17,993
[Seeker is gone for four minutes]

214
00:12:20,217 --> 00:12:22,896
[Only ALLDAY PROJECT is left here]

215
00:12:22,897 --> 00:12:26,016
[Time left until the seeker is back]
[Rustling]

216
00:12:30,370 --> 00:12:32,896
I'm going to use this paper

217
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:38,449
[Going to block the door with paper]

218
00:12:38,450 --> 00:12:39,727
There we go!

219
00:12:40,519 --> 00:12:43,491
[Tries to cover it up so she won't get caught even if someone
opens the fire cabinet]

220
00:12:54,654 --> 00:12:55,808
Okay

221
00:12:55,809 --> 00:12:57,785
I'll tape that there

222
00:13:11,465 --> 00:13:14,820
This is why people need to learn
how to use tools

223
00:13:15,795 --> 00:13:18,454
[But the paper keeps sliding down]

224
00:13:18,455 --> 00:13:21,891
It's fine ANNIE, stay calm

225
00:13:22,888 --> 00:13:25,328
You can do it

226
00:13:25,527 --> 00:13:32,687
[Time left until the seeker is back]

227
00:13:35,558 --> 00:13:37,637
[Trap]

228
00:13:39,738 --> 00:13:41,423
-Has it been 2,222 seconds?
-It has

229
00:13:41,424 --> 00:13:42,417
You can leave!

230
00:13:42,418 --> 00:13:44,302
-Use your key
-Oh, I'll use my key

231
00:13:44,303 --> 00:13:45,964
WOOCHAN is going to use a key

232
00:13:45,965 --> 00:13:47,804
Is this the right thing to do?

233
00:13:47,805 --> 00:13:49,167
You want to waste more time here?

234
00:13:49,168 --> 00:13:50,115
Yeah

235
00:13:50,365 --> 00:13:52,188
It's too late though

236
00:13:52,189 --> 00:13:54,453
-Okay
-You go to the place with the helmet and find the key

237
00:13:54,454 --> 00:13:55,994
Keep this with you

238
00:13:55,995 --> 00:13:57,673
Thank you

239
00:13:58,235 --> 00:14:00,321
[Handkerchief from WOOCHAN]
-Then I'll use this

240
00:14:00,322 --> 00:14:02,655
and how should I spend
this time alone?

241
00:14:05,180 --> 00:14:07,257
Am I dead in nine minutes?

242
00:14:07,258 --> 00:14:11,404
[Will WOOCHAN be able to save
YOUNGSEO within nine minutes]
-WOOCHAN! I only have nine minutes left!

243
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:13,511
He probably heard me, right?

244
00:14:14,002 --> 00:14:16,536
Okay, let's go to the helmet

245
00:14:17,194 --> 00:14:18,752
[TARZZAN]
[Time left until the seeker is back]

246
00:14:18,753 --> 00:14:20,860
[WOOCHAN]
-I'm back
-Huh? Okay

247
00:14:20,815 --> 00:14:22,220
There's no seeker for four minutes

248
00:14:22,221 --> 00:14:23,777
For four minutes? Okay

249
00:14:24,212 --> 00:14:26,411
[Key hint, 1st floor]
We need to find the helmet
within the four minutes

250
00:14:26,652 --> 00:14:27,711
It's over here!

251
00:14:27,712 --> 00:14:28,871
-Hey!
-It's slippery

252
00:14:30,214 --> 00:14:32,044
I'm totally carrying the group

253
00:14:37,529 --> 00:14:38,649
I'm carrying the group..

254
00:14:39,308 --> 00:14:40,449
That's not it, I'm sorry

255
00:14:40,450 --> 00:14:42,431
It has two helmets

256
00:14:42,432 --> 00:14:44,297
[Key hint, 1st floor]
[Right behind them but didn't see]
Let's check the basement!

257
00:14:44,298 --> 00:14:45,815
-It does say it's on the first floor
-Does it?

258
00:14:46,977 --> 00:14:49,607
[TARZZAN and WOOCHAN end up looking at the wrong place]

259
00:14:49,608 --> 00:14:51,729
There's supposed to be two helmets

260
00:14:51,730 --> 00:14:56,207
[Time until the seeker is back]
-A helmet
-We have to find it to save YOUNGSEO

261
00:14:56,526 --> 00:14:59,266
[BAILEY]
[BAILEY is still hiding in the basement]

262
00:14:59,949 --> 00:15:02,614
Where are the members?

263
00:15:04,032 --> 00:15:06,032
I miss them

264
00:15:09,665 --> 00:15:14,159
